OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FAny showers
OL,6,Fwill become light and well scattered
OL,7,Fthis evening. Showers will then die
OL,8,Fout overnight though it will be mostly
OL,9,Fcloudy. A milder night.
OL,10,
OL,11,CThursday:FThursday will be mainly dry,
OL,12,Fthough quite cloudy with a few light
OL,13,Fshowers. Some sunshine around too.
OL,14,
OL,15,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FA dry
OL,16,Fstart Friday then clouding over,
OL,17,Foccasional rain. Saturday cloudy with
OL,18,Foccasional rain then Sunday dry with
OL,19,Fsome sunshine.
